          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Jesu uhu uwangwagha Justo. Awa wiekeri niwo wayahudi, wiko aghadi ya wandu wawuyabonya kazi chiaimweri nani, kwa wundu ghwa Wuzuri ghwa Mlungu; nawo werekoghe wikinihoresha ngolo nandighi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafra mumzenyu, nao ni mdumiki wa Kristo Jesu, wamroghua. Wawuyamlombia nandighi ngelo rose, mkaie wandu mzoghue mmangishiro, muichi putu ulo lukundo lose lwa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wakol. 1.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHM.1.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "File. 23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ini namshuhudia kukaia wabonyere kazi mbaa kwa wundu ghonyu, na kwa wundu ghwa wandu wa Laodikea, na Hierapoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luka uo mghanga mkundwa, na Dema wamroghua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim. 4.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.4.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHM.1.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "File. 24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niroghuenyi wanidu wa Laodikea, na Nimfa, chiaimweri na ijo ikanisa jikwaniagha nyumbenyi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkameria kushomelwa ihi barua, bonyenyi ishomelo ikanisa ja Walaodikea wori, na inyo mshome iyo barua ifumie ikanisa ja Laodikea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzerenyi Arikipo huwu: “Manya kughukatishe wudumuki ugho kughupatire kufuma kwa Bwana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
